---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import NewsletterForm from "../components/NewsletterForm.astro";
---

<Page
  title="Weekly True Crime Newsletter | Bone Chilling Tales"
  description="One email a week with new case stories and updates on the cases we follow. Free. Quit any time."
  heading="The weekly email"
>
  <p slot="lead" class="lead">
    Every week you get the new stories and any updates on cases we follow: arrests, trials, new leads. That's it.
  </p>

  <NewsletterForm slot="after" heading="Sign up" body="Free. One email a week." />

  <section slot="after" class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Before you sign up</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>How often?</dt>
      <dd>Once a week. Sometimes a short extra email if there's big news in a case we follow.</dd>
      <dt>Can I quit?</dt>
      <dd>Yes. Every email has an unsubscribe link at the bottom.</dd>
      <dt>Will you sell my email?</dt>
      <dd>No.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .lead {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .faq {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .faq h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
  }

  dt {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  dd {
    margin: var(--space-3xs) 0 0;
  }
</style>
